WHAT THIS FILE IS FOR
---------------------
en-words-*.txt is a full-form list and answers "is this English".
en-lemmas-*.txt is a lemma index and answers "is this a BASE form".

They are different questions and need different data. "churches" is English but
is not a base form, and the guesser is asked for base forms. With only a
full-form list that distinction has to be inferred by heuristic; with a lemma
index it is exact — a real word that is not a lemma is an inflected form.

Only single-word, purely alphabetic lemmas of length 2–12 are kept.
